          empty, loading, streaming, complete, failed, filtered-empty, and
          unavailable states. Streaming, complete, and failed compose linked List
          Box Variants (the widgets.List foundation), normal scrollbar, Trace Group
          Row, and Trace Step Row instances in chronological order. The failed
          state keeps a linked selected failed step as its supplied anchor. The
          clipped viewport documents long/nested content and large-trace scrolling;
          unavailable explicitly covers a missing host-evidence or raw-log anchor.
          Filtering, capture, raw rendering, and failure formatting remain outside.

3.5 DwarfSpec components: Evidence Value Block and Failure Comparison:
